# Aniki zones

Work in **Discover → Plan → Solve → Build → Operate**. One zone per stretch of work unless the user says **continue** / **chain**.

| Zone | Writes | Does not |
|------|--------|----------|
| Discover | `docs/discovery/<slug>/` | Product code, APIs |
| Plan | `docs/stories/<slug>/` | Architecture ADRs, code |
| Solve | `docs/architecture/<slug>/` | App implementation |
| Build | `apps/`, `packages/`, `crates/` | Inventing contracts Solve did not hand off |
| Operate | `docs/playbook/`, health/CI/runbooks | New features |

Handoffs live in `.cursor/plans/<slug>/`. Append learnings to `.cursor/plans/<slug>/learnings.md`.

This is **not** a GP-Frodo workspace. Do not run `init-frodo-workspace`, FSA Phases 0–7, Event Catalog, SAM, MFE/Lyra, PBAC, Jira publish, or Vocal/Genie. Load Frodo skills **by name** only with Aniki output paths. Isolated `@threat-modeller` / `@solutions-architect` must be told: no FSA.
